# Feedback

This journal holds the owner's instructions, corrections and approved approaches on the way of working. The entries go in date order and are only added to. "I" in an entry is the agent that wrote it.

Entry format:
- heading: `### F<n> — YYYY-MM-DD — <title> [tag]`;
- `**Quote:**` — the owner's words (verbatim where possible);
- `**Context:**` — the situation in which they were said;
- `**Result:**` — what changed and which rule it became (`→ R<n>`).

An entry that became a standing rule stands in short form in `AGENTS.md` → `Rules`.

### F1 — {{YYYY-MM-DD}} — {{title}} [workflow]
- **Quote:** "{{the owner's words}}"
- **Context:** {{while the pan-harness was being made, the answer to a question on style}}
- **Result:** {{what changed}}. → R{{…}}
